{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360850/extras/hitw_02.gif?t=1737542317\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nature's balance lies in the paws of a transforming fox pup.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During a magical open-world adventure, you learn abilities from animal friends and glide, swim and leap across diverse landscapes uncovering the mystery of dying nature. As you progress, storybook pages turn, revealing your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360850/extras/hitw_04.gif?t=1737542317\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Transforming Fox\u200b:</strong> Adapt to your surroundings by transforming into either an arctic fox or a red fox.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Open-world Exploration:</strong> Explore vibrant forests, navigate icy terrains, swim through vast ocean and unravel the secrets of a fading ecosystem.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Various Main &amp; Side Quests\u200b:</strong> Embark on a compelling journey with animal companions on various main and side quests, each revealing new abilities for you to use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360850/extras/hitw_03.gif?t=1737542317\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique Abilities\u200b:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gliding, Swimming, Freezing, Charge Jump, Rock smashing, Telegrab and more!</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>World Restoration:\u00a0</strong>Witness the environment transform as you progress within the story as color and vibrancy returns to the world. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Storybook-Inspired Narrative</strong>: Immerse yourself in a narrative told through a beautifully illustrated storybook style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360850/extras/hitw_01.gif?t=1737542317\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Started as a passionate student project in Finland, Harmony in the Wild grew beyond our dreams and inspired us to form our own indie studio!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Thank you for joining us on this adventure.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3360850?t=1737542317","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360850/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1737542317","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360850/178c529eb0723ea88bf970b00b9f007f234314a5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1737542317","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360850/178c529eb0723ea88bf970b00b9f007f234314a5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1737542317","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3385150,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360850/extras/hitw_02.gif?t=1737542317\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nature's balance lies in the paws of a transformi